  Tapeosaurus
  Based on TrueTape64 by Francesco Vannini
  https://github.com/francescovannini/truetape64

  This port adapts the original ATTiny2313 firmware and Python CLI to the
  Wemos D1 Mini (ESP8266) platform. The TAP format output, timing model,
  and core concept are the work of the original author.

